WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.820
The queen scratched her arms.

2
00:00:07.821 --> 00:00:12.243
"We cleaned the whole castle!" she moaned.

3
00:00:12.244 --> 00:00:15.423
"The fleas are still here."

4
00:00:15.424 --> 00:00:19.526
"I'm itchy!" the king cried.

5
00:00:19.527 --> 00:00:23.066
A rat ran into the Throne Room.

6
00:00:23.067 --> 00:00:27.949
"Eek! Now we have rats!" Princess Mary cried.

7
00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:31.867
"Do something, Wizard!" the king yelled.

8
00:00:31.868 --> 00:00:35.024
More rats ran in.

9
00:00:35.025 --> 00:00:38.138
Cat jumped out of Tom's pocket.

10
00:00:38.139 --> 00:00:40.247
Tom waved his wand.

11
00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:43.579
"Scat, rats!" Tom cried.

12
00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.517
The rats saw the cat.

13
00:00:46.518 --> 00:00:49.279
They ran out.

14
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:54.289
"Good job, Wizard!" the king said.

15
00:00:54.290 --> 00:00:57.943
"Where did the rats come from?" Tom asked.

16
00:00:57.944 --> 00:01:02.672
"Rats like dirty dungeons," Cat whispered.

17
00:01:02.673 --> 00:01:06.184
"And fleas like rats!"

18
00:01:06.185 --> 00:01:08.385
Tom looked at Dirk.

19
00:01:08.386 --> 00:01:12.024
"Fleas like rats," he said.

20
00:01:12.025 --> 00:01:15.131
"Did you clean the Grim Dungeon?"

21
00:01:15.132 --> 00:01:19.280
"No one cleans dungeons!" Dirk snapped.

22
00:01:19.281 --> 00:01:21.441
The queen frowned.

23
00:01:21.442 --> 00:01:25.099
"This is your fault, Dirk!" she said.

24
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:29.702
"Clean that dirty dungeon at once!"

25
00:01:29.703 --> 00:01:34.393
"Servants!" Dirk yelled. "Clean the dungeon!"

26
00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:40.817
"I told you to clean it," said the queen.

27
00:01:40.818 --> 00:01:51.667
Dirk stomped out of the Throne Room.

28
00:01:51.668 --> 00:01:56.077
He went to clean the Grim Dungeon.

29
00:01:56.078 --> 00:01:58.497
The king turned to Tom.

30
00:01:58.498 --> 00:02:05.428
"Now make these fleas go away!" he said.

31
00:02:05.429 --> 00:02:07.996
Tom waved his wand.

32
00:02:07.997 --> 00:02:13.816
"Fleas, flee!" he cried. "Be gone!"

33
00:02:13.817 --> 00:02:18.176
The fleas turned to bees!

34
00:02:18.177 --> 00:02:21.211
They flew around the room.

35
00:02:21.212 --> 00:02:24.340
"Run!" the king cried.

36
00:02:24.341 --> 00:02:32.724
"Oops," Tom said.

